    "collapsible_tabs_kppEa7": {
      "type": "collapsible-tabs",
      "blocks": {
        "content_VCpkQM": {
          "type": "content",
          "settings": {
            "icon": "none",
            "title": "How does it work? ",
            "content": "<p>With our Wine Club, you can select the wine type you enjoy most, and we deliver a carefully curated 6 or 12 bottle case right to your door, 4 times a year.  You can even gift a <a href=\"https://www.kiwicru.com/collections/gift-boxes\" title=\"https://www.kiwicru.com/collections/gift-boxes\">membership</a> too.</p>",
            "custom_liquid": "",
            "content_page": "",
            "open": false
          }
        },
        "content_gLrAXV": {
          "type": "content",
          "settings": {
            "icon": "none",
            "title": "How much does it cost?   ",
            "content": "<p>Prices start at £135 per quarter for our special white wine selection. Plus, we guarantee that we’ll always send you wines which are more valuable than the price you pay. </p>",
            "custom_liquid": "",
            "content_page": "",
            "open": false
          }
        },
        "content_kyx8Kp": {
          "type": "content",
          "settings": {
            "icon": "none",
            "title": "What are the other benefits to being a member?  ",
            "content": "<p>You'll receive online discounts, free delivery and exclusive invitations to our member-only events. You can even gift a membership too. </p>",
            "custom_liquid": "",
            "content_page": "",
            "open": false
          }
        },
        "content_GyrnTU": {
          "type": "content",
          "settings": {
            "icon": "none",
            "title": "How do I gift a membership?  ",
            "content": "<p>It’s really easy – just choose who it’s for when you go through the checkout process, and enter their delivery address (if it’s different from yours). You can add a gift note too of course. </p>",
            "custom_liquid": "",
            "content_page": "",
            "open": false
          }
        },
        "content_TwwRGa": {
          "type": "content",
          "settings": {
            "icon": "none",
            "title": "When does the first delivery arrive?   ",
            "content": "<p>We’ll deliver your first selection straight after you’ve signed up, including individual tasting sheets with everything you want to know about the wines and the people who made them. And of course we’ll share some of our ideas on food pairings too. </p>",
            "custom_liquid": "",
            "content_page": "",
            "open": false
          }
        },
        "content_KTVPiM": {
          "type": "content",
          "settings": {
            "icon": "none",
            "title": "What if I want to change my case? ",
            "content": "<p>It’s no problem, just log into your account and ‘Swap this for a different product’.</p>",
            "custom_liquid": "",
            "content_page": "",
            "open": false
          }
        },
        "content_HfdzCF": {
          "type": "content",
          "settings": {
            "icon": "none",
            "title": "Can I cancel my subscription?  ",
            "content": "<p>Yes, your membership is completely flexible. If you log into your account, you can click on ‘Cancel my subscription’ </p>",
            "custom_liquid": "",
            "content_page": "",
            "open": false
          }
        }
      },
